  _dialogue:
    _sentences:
    - Hey sweetheart, the kids and I have already headed to the new place.
    - ' I would have woken you up, but you were sleeping so well, and I know how
      you don''t sleep anymore...'
    - We're gonna unpack and settle in for a bit - we're just so excited about the
      move!
    - Anyway, I have a job for you. We need pictures for any of the old junk we want
      to sell online - no use cluttering up the new place with it!
    - Do you remember my old camcorder? I left it downd
